{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國街頭美食向來款式豐富，首爾一間韓式餐酒館，以新穎食材與烹調手法，碰撞出別具特色的風味。</p><p>另有店家順應年輕食客的口味與打卡潮流，為街頭料理換上新貌。</p><p>香港亦有餐廳引進韓式大牌檔氛圍，給本地食客提供消夜好去處。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;------</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T10:23:59.638820+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T10:00:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T10:17:16.339674+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T10:17:16.339674+00:00","content_hash":"08985c3dc12c956f34821357004f8c841d70464e9b94cd53a29bf26240e989fe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}